{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18260410","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826040001:":{"text":"더는 못 기다리겠어.","source_cn":"我快等不下去了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9608A58065F70DE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826040002:":{"text":"수선의 집은 대체 언제 다시 문을 여는 거야?","source_cn":"修缮屋什么时候才能重新开张？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3EE0A4742C6E81C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826040003:":{"text":"서둘러 봐야 소용 없어.","source_cn":"急也没用","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA89A755FF69A93F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826040004:":{"text":"무슨 고민이라도 있나?","source_cn":"有什么烦恼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F549C6DB956AEFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826041001:1":{"text":"무슨 일로 고민하고 있는 거지?","source_cn":"两位贵族朋友，你们在为什么事而烦恼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E608D73762A66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826041002:1":{"text":"수선의 집 이야기를 하는 것 같던데... 신선한 신체가 부족해서 그런 건가?","source_cn":"我似乎隐约听你们提到了修缮屋……莫非是因为缺少新鲜的断肢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8120661A640063B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826041003:1":{"text":"아니, 노바리스의 신체 공급에는 문제가 없네. 문제는 의사가 없다는 거지.","source_cn":"不，诺珐斯早已不缺肢体供给。现在的问题是没有医师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B76064C43459F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826041004:1":{"text":"수선의 집에서 일하던 뮤리엘 할멈이 수배된 이후로 자취를 감추어서, 어디로 갔는지 아무도 모르거든.","source_cn":"修缮屋以前的医师是穆婆婆，但她被通缉以后，就莫名其妙地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD509D3A8D40204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826041005:1":{"text":"무슨 이유인지 영주님께서도 수선의 집에 새로운 의사를 보내지 않으셔서... 내 무릎과 손목은 아직까지 괜찮지만, 눈은 이미 한계라고!","source_cn":"不知道为何，领主阁下也没有派遣新的医师接手修缮屋……我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11A5710539503814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826041006:1":{"text":"오? 노바리스에는 다른 의사가 없나?","source_cn":"哦？诺珐斯城内难道没有其他医师了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA81F303E19747A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826041007:1":{"text":"물론 있지. 하지만 전부 뮤리엘 할멈만 못해. 애초에 영주님 허가를 받은 의사는 할멈뿐이었으니까.","source_cn":"自然是有的，只是他们的技术都不如穆婆婆精湛。毕竟她是唯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D55192935F98811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826041008:1":{"text":"귀족인 내가 바가지나 씌우는 허름한 곳에서 수술을 받을 수는 없지.","source_cn":"身为贵族，我是绝不会去那些黑心小作坊接受手术的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE93BAAF7D8442713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826041009:1":{"text":"그런 거였군...","source_cn":"原来是这样啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6B5AC663AFF32A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826041010:1":{"text":"안심해도 좋다. <style=\"highlight\">내가 편지로 노바리스의 상황을 토란 님께 보고드리지</style>. 머지않아 훌륭한 의사가 고민을 해결해 줄 것이야.","source_cn":"请放心，我的贵族朋友。<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8147221D2A388DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826041011:1":{"text":"오? 그거 정말인가? 이렇게 친절할 수가!","source_cn":"哦，真的吗？您可真是一位热心的绅士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x877758B124082D7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826041012:1":{"text":"후후... 내가 “친절”한 걸 좋아하긴 하지.","source_cn":"呵呵……我的确很喜欢“热心”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92012DF1A744A798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826041013:1":{"text":"차림새를 보아하니 반티스 출신 귀족이신 듯한데? 시간 괜찮다면 초승달이 뜨는 날 내 집들이 연회에 참석해줄 수 있나?","source_cn":"这位先生，看您的打扮，应该是来自班题斯的贵族吧？如果您...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF32E4FB9A5A604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826041014:1":{"text":"아무래도 이런 신사와 인연을 맺을 기회는 흔치 않으니까.","source_cn":"毕竟，能结交您这样的绅士的机会可不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82C564F77A63B00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826041015:1":{"text":"연회 초대를 받다니, 이런 영광이.","source_cn":"能收到你的邀请，真是我的无上荣幸啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1929C85C90656CFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826041016:1":{"text":"잠시 후 다른 일정이 있다만, 일이 끝나는 대로 반드시 방문하도록 하지.","source_cn":"我稍后还有安排，等我的事情结束后，一定前往你的府邸拜访。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCFD6293FFDEC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1826041017:1":{"text":"저... 슬레이저 님...","source_cn":"斯莱泽先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4A808F7056BC2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1826041018:1":{"text":"...잘됐군! 이건 내 저택의 주소라네. 부디 잘 보관해 주오.","source_cn":"——真是太棒了！这是我府邸的地址，请您务必收好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x722018E34387B76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1826041019:1":{"text":"그럼 방문을 기다리도록 하지.","source_cn":"那么，我们就在家中恭候您的到来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB07DA70017EAB66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1826041020:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1826041021:1":{"text":"몇 가지 궁금한 게 있는데.","source_cn":"我有一些疑问，不知道你能否为我解答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AE2922FFB470087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1826041022:1":{"text":"수선의 집 의사였던 뮤리엘 할멈은 어디로 갔지? 친위대도 붙잡는 데 실패했다던데.","source_cn":"修缮屋原来的医生——那个被通缉的穆婆婆，她去哪了？禁卫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF434E44B252E5A89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1826041023:1":{"text":"죄송합니다. 저는 모티머 장원 내부 일만을 담당하고 있어서 도시의 사정에 대해서는 잘 모릅니다.","source_cn":"我只负责莫蒂默庄园内的事务，不清楚城内政务。请您谅解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF167080C3B72A1B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1826041024:1":{"text":"그럼 질문을 바꾸지. 뮤리엘 할멈이 사라진 지도 꽤 지났는데, 왜 아직 새 의사가 오지 않은 거지? 설마 테페시아 님께는, 의사 하나 임명하는 것조차 어려운 일인 건가?","source_cn":"那么我换个问题。为什么穆婆婆失踪了多日，新医师还没有上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5152FC71CA7A43D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1826041025:0":{"text":"难不成……<u><link=Case><style=highlight>她出了什么意外？</style></link></u>","source_cn":"难不成……<u><link=Case><style=h...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1EF30CDC016114B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1826041026:1":{"text":"지나친 걱정이십니다. 영주님께는 아무 일도 없으십니다. 다만 최근 정무가 바빠 아직 처리하지 못한 일이 많을 뿐입니다.","source_cn":"您多虑了，领主阁下一切安好。只是因为最近政务繁忙，很多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2D6A8CC745BDC52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1826041027:1":{"text":"그러니까, 너무 게을러서 그렇다는 말인가?","source_cn":"你是想告诉我，是因为她太懒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0076454514DA87B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1826041028:1":{"text":"영주님의 성미야, 다들 잘 알고 계시지 않습니까.","source_cn":"领主阁下的心性，有目共睹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E96B6613AE5A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1826041029:1":{"text":"그렇지... 그러니 내가 도무지 반박할 수가 없군.","source_cn":"是啊……所以才能令我无从反驳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00A5D7BB750789CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1826041030:1":{"text":"가지. <style=\"highlight\">조금 더 둘러보는 게 좋겠군</style>. 도시 안에는 아직 신경 쓰이는 일이 많으니.","source_cn":"走吧，<style=highlight>再带我四处逛逛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB16825F4BC75D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族伊默金":{"text":"귀족 이머진","source":"贵族伊默金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族昆廷":{"text":"귀족 켄틴","source":"贵族昆廷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"슬레이저","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:仆人崔斯":{"text":"하인 트레스","source":"仆人崔斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":36,"localized_text_count":34,"speaker_count":4}}